{"type":"record","name":"StrikeInvasionSnapshot","namespace":"com.optionsedge.contracts.strikeinvasion","doc":"Latest per-strike, per-direction strike-invasion record on options.spx.strike-invasion.current (compacted, keyed '<strike>:UP' / '<strike>:DOWN'). Until the Avro cutover this topic carried the Jackson JSON of the Java record com.optionsedge.contracts.strikeinvasion.StrikeInvasionSnapshot; this schema reproduces it FIELD FOR FIELD, NAME FOR NAME and IN THE SAME ORDER. Prices (strike, invalidationLevel) are decimal(38,18) carrying the shortest round-trip text of the engine's double, so BigDecimal.doubleValue() returns the identical double; scores and ratios stay double, as every existing canonical schema keeps statistical ratios. A null value on the topic is the compaction tombstone written at a session boundary and never carries a payload. READ verdictCalibrated FIRST: every decision field is UNCALIBRATED while it is false (see the Java record's javadoc). PRICE DOMAIN: every decimal(38,18) field accepts exactly the finite doubles whose shortest round-trip text has at most 18 fractional digits and magnitude below 1e20, and never negative zero; any other value is refused by the codec (never rounded) and the service counts and logs the refusal instead of publishing.","fields":[{"name":"schemaVersion","type":"int","doc":"Wire revision of the record; 5 today."},{"name":"symbol","type":"string","doc":"SPX."},{"name":"direction","type":"string","doc":"UP (resistance, short calls) or DOWN (support, short puts)."},{"name":"strike","type":{"type":"bytes","logicalType":"decimal","precision":38,"scale":18},"doc":"REAL (un-reflected) strike price."},{"name":"asOfEventTimeMs","type":"long","doc":"Event time of the spot tick that produced the record, epoch ms."},{"name":"state","type":"string","doc":"DORMANT | WATCHING | APPROACH | INVASION_PENDING | ACCEPTED_ABOVE | ACCEPTED_BELOW | FAILED_INVASION | RETIRED."},{"name":"attemptNumber","type":"int"},{"name":"attemptHistory","type":"string","doc":"Compact, e.g. '2 (F,F)'."},{"name":"ips","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Stage-1 invasion probability score; null before Stage 1 has run.","default":null},{"name":"forecast","type":"string","doc":"INVASION_LIKELY | CONTESTED | HOLD_LIKELY | NONE."},{"name":"etaSeconds","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Display only; null when receding.","default":null},{"name":"f1","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"f2","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"f3","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"f4","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"f5","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"df","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"vs","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"composite","type":["null","double"],"doc":"Stage-2 authentication composite; null until an authentication resolves.","default":null},{"name":"compM","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"compG","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"compP","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"compVobs","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"compDf","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"compVs","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"reinvasionBias","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"verdict","type":"string","doc":"SHORT_CALL_CANDIDATE | SHORT_PUT_CANDIDATE | DO_NOT_SHORT | PRE_CANDIDATE | UNCERTAIN | NO_TRADE | NONE."},{"name":"grade","type":"string","doc":"'A' | 'B' | '-'."},{"name":"invalidationLevel","type":["null",{"type":"bytes","logicalType":"decimal","precision":38,"scale":18}],"doc":"A live short candidate's stop in REAL price space; null otherwise.","default":null},{"name":"reasonCodes","type":{"type":"array","items":"string"}},{"name":"governorNotch","type":"string","doc":"RELAXED | BASE | TIGHTENED."},{"name":"modelVersion","type":"string"},{"name":"configHash","type":"string"},{"name":"wallBreakPct","type":["null","double"],"doc":"SHADOW wall break-rate evidence (schema v3); null unless wallReason is OK.","default":null},{"name":"wallResidualPct","type":["null","double"],"default":null},{"name":"wallObservations","type":["null","int"],"default":null},{"name":"wallCallAskSize","type":["null","long"],"default":null},{"name":"wallSizeDecides","type":["null","boolean"],"default":null},{"name":"wallReason","type":["null","string"],"doc":"OK | NO_CELL | STALE_QUOTE | OUT_OF_MEASURED_RANGE | NO_RESTING_SIZE | INSUFFICIENT_SUPPORT; null when the shadow path is off or on a DOWN record.","default":null},{"name":"wallTableVersion","type":["null","string"],"default":null},{"name":"verdictCalibrated","type":"boolean","doc":"FENCE (schema v4): false means ips/forecast/composite/verdict/grade are UNCALIBRATED."},{"name":"calibrationRef","type":"string","doc":"Which measurement says so."},{"name":"updatedAtMs","type":"long"}]}